---
/* Sessions and fees. Wording is Emily's; the free call is pulled out as the natural first step. */
---
<div class="fees">
  <h2>Sessions and fees</h2>
  <p class="fees__call">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.5 3.5h3l1.5 4-2 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-2 4 1.5v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 4.5 5.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" /></svg>
    <span><strong>Free 20-minute consultation call</strong> via phone or video</span>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>£60 per session</li>
    <li>Block of 6 weekly sessions for £300</li>
    <li>Limited concession slots for those on lower incomes</li>
    <li>I understand that therapy is an investment and can therefore accommodate fortnightly sessions to spread the cost</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .fees__call { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); background: var(--sage-tint); border: 1px solid var(--sage); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .fees__call svg { flex: none; width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; fill: none; stroke: var(--sage-deep); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.2em; margin: 0; max-width: var(--measure); }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
</style>
